  ] as const;
  ...
  const TRACEABILITY_RULE_SEVERITIES = {
    "traceability/valid-req-reference": "error",
    ...
  } as const;
- This confirms the rule participates in the core plugin configuration and is treated as an error in recommended/strict configs.

6) User experience and error messages (User Experience and REQ-DEEP-ERROR):
- Rule meta messages in src/rules/valid-req-reference.ts:
