- tests/rules/valid-req-reference.test.ts header links directly to this story:
  /**
   * Tests for: docs/stories/010.0-DEV-DEEP-VALIDATION.story.md
   * @story docs/stories/010.0-DEV-DEEP-VALIDATION.story.md
